# BeatGuider — Cloudflare Pages redirect rules
# Format: source destination status
# www.beatguider.com is a proxied CNAME to the apex and is NOT attached
# as a Pages custom domain, so these rules only fire for requests that
# reach the Pages project directly. The owner will additionally add a
# zone-level Redirect Rule as the authoritative fix.

https://www.beatguider.com/*  https://beatguider.com/:splat  301
http://beatguider.com/*       https://beatguider.com/:splat  301
http://www.beatguider.com/*   https://beatguider.com/:splat  301